      {
        "id": "h1",
        "type": "heading",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Happy to be your penfriend, Ben!"
          }
        ],
        "level": 3
      },
      {
        "id": "d1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "March 3, 2026"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Dear Ben,"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "My English name is Troy. I am 14 years old and will be turning 15 next month. I was born in Hangzhou, and now I live in Shanghai. I saw your information and your picture in last month’s "
          },
          {
            "t": "em",
            "v": "Global Mail"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " magazine. I am happy to be your penfriend!"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Let me first introduce my family to you. There are three people in my family: my parents and me. My parents are both doctors at a local hospital. Although they often have to work long hours, I am proud of them because they help sick people. When I grow up, I also want to be a doctor."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "I am now an eighth-grader at Xinguang Middle School. I like my school because it is big and beautiful, and all of my teachers are very friendly. I usually arrive at school at 7:10. My first lesson starts at 8. We have four lessons in the morning and three in the afternoon. My favourite subject is Maths because it is not only fun but also useful."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "On Saturdays, I have private lessons. On Sundays, I am free. I often help with the housework. When I am not kept busy, I watch TV or read comic books. Sometimes, I go shopping or go to the cinema with my friends. About once a month, my parents and I go to visit my grandparents. They have also moved from Hangzhou to Shanghai."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "I hope to receive your email soon and learn more about you!"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p6",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Best wishes,"
          },
          {
            "t": "br"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Troy Wang"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
